      <title>China Communist Party Urges Tougher Action on Crypto Corruption</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-01/china-communist-party-urges-tougher-action-on-crypto-corruption</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">7a8b3931564dbe384d9c86f0</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 08:57:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>China’s Communist Party called for tougher action to combat corruption involving virtual currencies, cross-border funds, and collusion between officials and businesses, according to an authorized release via Xinhua News Agency on Sunday of a decision adopted on Oct. 29.</description>
