      <title>Binance Restarts Withdrawals as Questions Linger on Record Hack</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-01/binance-to-resume-customer-withdrawals-in-phases-after-hack</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f4756aba45b1e86fc8021fa5</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 04:59:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Binance began restoring customer withdrawals Sunday after hackers drained over $6 billion in the biggest cyber theft ever recorded, as the crypto industry awaits answers on the breach blamed on North Korea and steps to strengthen the exchange’s defenses.</description>
